---
import { regionGroups } from "../lib/content.mjs";

const links = regionGroups().slice(0, 8).map((group) => ({ href: `/region/${group.slug}/`, label: group.label }));
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <strong>트립뷰</strong>
      <p>국내외 여행지, 축제, 숙소 예약 정보를 지역과 목적별로 정리합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <b>카테고리</b>
      <a href="/travel/">여행지</a>
      <a href="/festival/">축제·행사</a>
      <a href="/stay/">숙소</a>
      <a href="/ticket/">입장권·투어</a>
      <a href="/tools/">여행 계획 도구</a>
      <a href="/tools/calendar/">여행 일정 달력</a>
      <a href="/tools/world-time/">세계시간 비교</a>
      <a href="/tools/#budget">여행 예산 계산</a>
      <a href="https://mustview.co.kr/train" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">기차 검색 · 레일맵 ↗</a>
      <a href="/guides/travel-budget/">2박 3일 예산 안내</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <b>지역 허브</b>
      {links.map((link) => <a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a>)}
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <b>운영</b>
      <a href="/editorial-team">편집팀</a>
      <a href="/editorial-policy">콘텐츠 운영 기준</a>
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">제휴 안내</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <b>정책</b>
      <a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a>
      <a href="/terms">이용약관</a>
      <a href="/sitemap.xml">사이트맵</a>
      <a href="/contact">문의</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>사업자 정보: 트립뷰 콘텐츠 운영</span>
      <span>Copyright 2026 Tripview.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
